WEBVTT

00:02.900 --> 00:04.740
A long, long time ago.

00:04.960 --> 00:07.640
A story from about a hundred years ago.

00:08.530 --> 00:13.280
Nadja, guided by
destiny, arrived in France.

00:17.480 --> 00:18.780
- NAAJA
- Nadja,

00:18.900 --> 00:20.170
With your eyes

00:20.171 --> 00:21.439
Kimi no hitomi ni wa

00:21.440 --> 00:22.650
- Nadja,
- NAAJA

00:22.690 --> 00:23.820
What do you see?

00:23.821 --> 00:24.950
Nani ga mieru

00:24.980 --> 00:26.425
Haruka tooku hikaru

00:26.426 --> 00:27.870
Shining in the far distance,

00:27.880 --> 00:29.070
The door to the future,

00:29.071 --> 00:30.260
Mirai no tobira

00:31.140 --> 00:32.880
That's what I'm searching for

00:32.881 --> 00:34.619
Sagashite iru

00:34.620 --> 00:41.840
Tomorrow's Nadja

00:42.540 --> 00:44.300
If everyone could meet with a smile

00:44.301 --> 00:46.060
Minna egao de aetara

00:46.140 --> 00:49.390
- I'm sure there would be no more fighting
- Arasoi mo kitto nakunaru

00:49.420 --> 00:51.025
It could be so much more fun

00:51.026 --> 00:52.630
Konna ni mo tanoshi kunaru

00:52.690 --> 00:54.400
The world is wide, but it's still one

00:54.401 --> 00:56.110
Sekai wa hiroi kedo hitotsu ne

00:56.470 --> 00:58.120
I can't see the end of the journey

00:58.121 --> 00:59.770
Tabi no owari wa mienai

00:59.890 --> 01:03.220
- God is the only one who could
possibly know - Kamisama ga tabun shitteru

01:03.410 --> 01:07.000
- To the people who, someday, I will meet
again - Itsukamata deaeru hito tachi ni

01:07.040 --> 01:08.100
I will go waving

01:08.101 --> 01:09.160
Te wo furinagara

01:09.240 --> 01:12.570
Sometimes, there are days I feel blue,

01:12.571 --> 01:15.900
Toki ni wa BURUU ni naru hi mo aru kedo

01:15.970 --> 01:17.325
But I won't look back

01:17.326 --> 01:18.680
Ushiro mukanai

01:19.010 --> 01:21.490
Until the day my dream comes true

01:21.491 --> 01:23.970
Yume ga kanau hi made

01:24.260 --> 01:25.970
Nadja, Your smile

01:25.971 --> 01:27.680
NAAJA kimi no hohoemi wa

01:27.740 --> 01:29.410
Nadja, gives me courage

01:29.411 --> 01:31.080
NAAJA yuuki ni naru

01:31.150 --> 01:32.610
Under the blue sky,

01:32.611 --> 01:34.070
Aoi sora no shita de

01:34.170 --> 01:35.585
I will find the place

01:35.586 --> 01:37.000
Ashita no yukue

01:37.330 --> 01:39.285
where my future lies

01:39.286 --> 01:41.240
Mitsukeru kara

01:52.800 --> 01:56.140
Today, we're performing in front
of the Arc de Triomphe...

01:56.240 --> 01:58.370
We'll draw the biggest crowd yet!

01:58.740 --> 02:01.540
I think you know, but today is
when we make our money!

02:01.600 --> 02:03.980
Everyone, I'm counting
on you to do it right!

02:04.230 --> 02:05.230
Yes!

02:23.500 --> 02:24.500
Thanks for your business!

02:24.830 --> 02:25.420
Huh?

02:25.830 --> 02:27.670
I've come to deliver your order.

02:28.000 --> 02:29.630
Oh! Thanks a lot!

02:32.160 --> 02:33.910
Ohhh... This is it! This is it!

02:37.490 --> 02:39.620
With this, I won't have
to worry for a while!

02:41.040 --> 02:42.200
So, how is it?

02:43.680 --> 02:44.680
Uh, Nadja!

02:45.400 --> 02:46.440
Nadja?

02:46.730 --> 02:48.600
How is it, Nadja? It
looks good on me, right?

03:01.600 --> 03:06.210
A Narrow Escape!!
A Confession of Love in Paris

04:02.800 --> 04:04.430
But, I was really surprised...

04:05.140 --> 04:08.180
that you would be dancing in a
traveling performance troupe.

04:08.310 --> 04:10.270
That's my line!

04:10.520 --> 04:13.820
You're supposed to be in London,
Oliver, so why are you in Paris?

04:14.020 --> 04:17.320
My master in London gave me an
introduction to a factory over here.

04:17.740 --> 04:19.780
You might not think so, but
I'm pretty good at this.

04:19.950 --> 04:20.570
I am!

04:20.930 --> 04:21.930
Really...

04:24.690 --> 04:26.560
But, I'm really glad...

04:27.580 --> 04:30.120
I heard from Alex that
you were safe, but...

04:30.580 --> 04:31.790
I was still worried.

04:33.000 --> 04:34.210
I'm sorry...

04:35.650 --> 04:36.650
That's all right...

04:36.920 --> 04:39.420
After all, I was able to see you again.

04:40.760 --> 04:42.770
I wonder how everyone is doing?

04:50.480 --> 04:51.480
Nadja...

04:51.940 --> 04:54.020
She always looks so pretty...

05:16.800 --> 05:17.800
Hey!

05:24.390 --> 05:26.850
I have to say it, this is my chance!

05:28.060 --> 05:29.060
Maybe today...

05:29.061 --> 05:32.520
I can finally c-c-confess to her...

05:33.560 --> 05:35.520
Y-You know what...

05:35.680 --> 05:37.730
I... Nadja, I...

05:37.770 --> 05:38.770
Nadja!

05:39.900 --> 05:41.160
Can you help... me?

05:47.170 --> 05:49.710
Is that Nadja really here?

05:50.290 --> 05:54.580
In the letter that was sent to the
orphanage, it said she was in Paris.

05:54.790 --> 05:56.710
We just have to keep at it and find her.

05:56.830 --> 05:59.880
But boss! You say
Paris, but where in Paris?

06:00.340 --> 06:03.720
And there's no guarantee
she's still in Paris.

06:04.330 --> 06:09.040
At this rate, we can't show our face to
Lord Herman and Duke Preminger!

06:09.640 --> 06:11.140
We don't have any other leads!

06:11.430 --> 06:13.230
So quit complaining and start looking!

06:13.480 --> 06:14.690
But boss!

06:14.890 --> 06:17.200
There's no way we'll find one missing
person in a city this size...

06:17.220 --> 06:18.220
Nadja!

06:18.310 --> 06:19.570
Hey! Over here!

06:26.160 --> 06:27.370
We found her...

06:28.490 --> 06:29.490
Now!

06:29.780 --> 06:31.040
What are you doing? Let's go!

06:31.080 --> 06:32.790
Uh! Oh, ah, wait!

06:39.360 --> 06:40.440
Those two!

06:40.470 --> 06:41.470
What's the matter?

06:41.710 --> 06:42.710
Let's go!

06:43.380 --> 06:44.970
Never mind! Just hurry!

06:45.680 --> 06:46.680
Okay.

06:48.910 --> 06:50.370
Stop!

06:51.060 --> 06:53.560
Nadja! Just what's going on?!

06:53.660 --> 06:55.170
I'll explain later!

07:00.150 --> 07:01.150
Nadja!

07:01.550 --> 07:02.760
In that case... This way!

07:20.670 --> 07:21.790
Nadja! This way!

07:21.840 --> 07:22.840
Okay!

07:33.100 --> 07:34.100
They've disappeared...

07:34.720 --> 07:36.430
On the contrary!

07:42.140 --> 07:43.860
Don't think you can get away.

07:52.330 --> 07:54.240
Let's kill some time here...

07:54.540 --> 07:55.540
If we do that...

07:55.750 --> 07:57.500
they'll probably give up and go home.

07:58.000 --> 07:59.710
B-But... what is this place?

07:59.960 --> 08:02.106
Won't we get in trouble for entering
without permission?

08:02.130 --> 08:03.130
It'll be fine.

08:03.420 --> 08:06.260
That's because... this is where I work!

08:14.100 --> 08:15.140
Isn't it great?

08:15.640 --> 08:20.230
A saddle is made completely by one
craftsman, who's responsible for its quality.

08:20.530 --> 08:21.530
By one person?

08:21.940 --> 08:22.560
Yeah!

08:22.730 --> 08:24.650
From beginning to end by one person.

08:24.980 --> 08:27.940
The reputation of the shop depends
on it, so it's a big responsibility.

08:28.180 --> 08:29.180
Wow...

08:30.030 --> 08:33.120
There are people who say that
cars will take over, but...

08:33.350 --> 08:34.720
this shop will be fine!

08:34.950 --> 08:36.990
That's because this is where we're unique!

08:37.620 --> 08:40.830
Wouldn't it be nice if you can start
making saddles soon too, Oliver?

08:41.790 --> 08:43.500
I'll show you soon enough!

08:44.250 --> 08:45.250
That's because

08:45.340 --> 08:48.170
I'm the man who's going to make
the best saddles in the world!

08:52.010 --> 08:53.970
Come on, Nadja! I'll show
you something good

08:59.790 --> 09:00.790
Tada~!

09:01.340 --> 09:02.340
What's this?

09:02.750 --> 09:05.170
It's a letter from everybody at Applefield!

09:05.920 --> 09:06.920
Take a look.

09:17.140 --> 09:18.180
Alex...

09:19.120 --> 09:20.120
Rosemary...

09:20.790 --> 09:21.790
Nicole...

09:22.430 --> 09:23.430
Daisy...

09:23.790 --> 09:24.790
Phoebe...

09:25.080 --> 09:26.780
Daniel, Peter...

09:27.120 --> 09:28.180
and Timothy!

09:28.900 --> 09:31.400
I hope that... everyone's
doing all right...

09:32.300 --> 09:33.340
They're fine!

09:33.630 --> 09:36.010
Their one talent is being cheerful.

09:36.380 --> 09:37.380
I have to agree.

09:37.970 --> 09:39.970
Anyway, I'd like you to tell me...

09:40.310 --> 09:42.100
Why are you being chased, Nadja?

09:48.400 --> 09:49.860
I don't know the reason...

09:50.280 --> 09:52.180
but those two suddenly attacked me.

09:52.680 --> 09:55.440
They wanted my mother's brooch.

09:56.350 --> 09:58.850
They caused the fire, but...

09:59.560 --> 10:03.080
I didn't want to bring any more trouble
to everyone at the orphanage.

10:03.790 --> 10:04.820
So that's why...

10:05.130 --> 10:07.460
That's why you didn't come
back to the orphanage...

10:07.920 --> 10:09.630
But... it turned out okay, didn't it?

10:09.920 --> 10:12.160
Your mother may be alive right?

10:13.550 --> 10:16.430
If there's anything I can
do, don't hesitate to ask.

10:16.910 --> 10:19.750
Whatever happens, I'll
always be on your side.

10:20.250 --> 10:22.040
Thank you, Oliver!

10:25.060 --> 10:27.060
Um... I

10:27.690 --> 10:28.860
Nadja I!

10:29.250 --> 10:31.130
I mean... I lo-

10:42.210 --> 10:43.210
Those two!

10:43.370 --> 10:44.370
What's the matter?

10:45.420 --> 10:47.330
Are you looking for something?

10:47.670 --> 10:48.360
Sirs..!

10:48.670 --> 10:51.130
Sirs? Us?

10:51.140 --> 10:52.600
Very well! Very well!

10:52.800 --> 10:56.680
We like business to be done
quickly and without fuss.

10:58.680 --> 11:00.220
I'm looking for a cat.

11:00.640 --> 11:02.200
It must be in this shop.

11:02.520 --> 11:03.280
A cat?

11:03.430 --> 11:06.560
A platinum blonde kitten with blue eyes.

11:06.570 --> 11:07.820
Its name is Nadja.

11:07.980 --> 11:09.500
I have no idea...

11:09.510 --> 11:12.260
I would have noticed a
kitten like that right away.

11:12.280 --> 11:13.610
It's no use hiding her!

11:14.920 --> 11:17.760
There were no other places
she could have run to.

11:21.160 --> 11:22.739
I'm terribly sorry.

11:22.740 --> 11:25.000
But this is a saddle shop.

11:25.160 --> 11:27.080
We have no cats here.

11:27.120 --> 11:28.686
You're going to pretend you
don't know anything?

11:28.710 --> 11:30.710
I don't know what you are referring to.

11:32.310 --> 11:33.310
Bianco!

11:34.170 --> 11:37.930
I'm sorry, too But. We are checking this
shop even if we have to use force.

11:39.010 --> 11:41.600
Oh? I want to see you try.

11:42.260 --> 11:43.320
What?!

12:03.480 --> 12:06.980
Nadja... while my master is keeping
them busy let's run!

12:10.360 --> 12:11.730
Nadja! Can you do it?

12:12.880 --> 12:15.090
It's nothing compared to climbing trees.

12:27.290 --> 12:29.200
Damn it! We won't forget this!

12:29.640 --> 12:31.650
Anyway, this confirms it...

12:32.690 --> 12:34.150
Nadja is in there.

12:34.320 --> 12:36.530
If we watch and wait she's
certain to come out.

12:37.190 --> 12:39.320
Bianco! Go watch the back.

12:40.890 --> 12:43.480
Ahhhhh! Boss!

12:46.360 --> 12:50.240
Damn it! They're making fools of us!

12:50.790 --> 12:51.960
I will...

12:52.380 --> 12:54.050
Never forgive you!

13:14.610 --> 13:15.730
Geez...

13:15.940 --> 13:18.109
What's so fun, that on my day off...

13:18.110 --> 13:20.990
I have to go shopping with my brother?

13:21.320 --> 13:22.570
Let me just mention. Herbie...

13:22.800 --> 13:26.130
Most of these stuff
are your daily supplies.

13:26.450 --> 13:28.610
It would be nice if you
were a little more grateful...

13:29.660 --> 13:31.500
Huh? Nadja?

13:34.390 --> 13:35.770
Herbie, take care of this.

13:36.130 --> 13:38.550
H-Hey! Hey! Wait a minute!

13:44.610 --> 13:45.520
Be careful!

13:45.570 --> 13:46.570
Idiot!

13:46.750 --> 13:47.750
Hurry!

13:51.060 --> 13:52.060
Those two just now...

13:52.120 --> 13:54.450
It couldn't be were they after Nadja?

14:05.160 --> 14:06.160
Bianco!

14:12.470 --> 14:13.890
W-Wait just a minute.

14:36.350 --> 14:38.360
I must have imagined it. Let's go!

14:41.650 --> 14:42.650
They're gone.

14:42.940 --> 14:43.940
Looks like it.

14:47.910 --> 14:49.950
Whew! That was close!

14:56.540 --> 14:58.790
This is... a great chance!

14:59.170 --> 15:00.670
Um... Nadja...

15:01.050 --> 15:03.130
I... Nadja, I. I lov-

15:03.280 --> 15:05.200
What's your relationship to Nadja?

15:07.610 --> 15:09.940
T.J! Why are you here?

15:09.990 --> 15:11.960
I saw you running...

15:12.160 --> 15:13.950
Anyway, who is this?

15:14.170 --> 15:15.300
This is Oliver.

15:15.360 --> 15:17.870
We were raised together
at Applefield Orphanage.

15:18.010 --> 15:20.760
Geez! Anyone and everyone
is getting in my way!

15:21.360 --> 15:23.740
In other words, he's NOT your boyfriend.

15:24.380 --> 15:25.550
Of course!

15:25.960 --> 15:28.360
That's cause we're family.

15:31.680 --> 15:32.760
Nice to meet you, Oliver.

15:33.490 --> 15:35.830
I think we'll get along fine.

15:36.160 --> 15:37.560
I'm Nadja's boyfrie-

15:37.580 --> 15:38.860
My friend, T.J!

15:42.420 --> 15:44.960
Oh! So, that means he's NOT her boyfriend.

15:45.150 --> 15:46.150
I found you.

15:49.300 --> 15:50.720
Nadja, this way!

15:53.470 --> 15:55.470
We're finished playing tag.

15:55.930 --> 15:58.100
You two... I thought
you went the other way!

15:58.520 --> 16:00.610
Roads are usually connected to each other.

16:00.920 --> 16:04.210
I went around in order to
trap you from both sides.

16:04.440 --> 16:05.570
Damn it!

16:05.990 --> 16:08.360
I'm not sure, but I
think this is really bad.

16:10.110 --> 16:11.370
Okay now, Miss.

16:11.530 --> 16:14.370
Sorry to be abrupt,
but give us that brooch.

16:14.570 --> 16:15.870
Not a chance!

16:16.040 --> 16:17.886
That's right... there's no reason
to give it to them!

16:17.910 --> 16:20.420
Don't worry, Nadja. We will...

16:20.580 --> 16:21.880
keep you safe!!

16:26.230 --> 16:27.919
Nadja! Hurry, get away!

16:27.920 --> 16:30.840
If you even lay a finger on
her, I won't forgive you!

16:30.990 --> 16:33.200
For your own good hand it over quietly.

16:33.220 --> 16:36.810
Or, your friends will meet unfortunate
circumstances.

16:40.060 --> 16:41.060
Cowards!

16:41.200 --> 16:42.600
Say anything you like.

16:42.700 --> 16:44.910
Sorry, but this is just business.

17:01.580 --> 17:03.960
Wow... Made in Germany...

17:03.980 --> 17:06.060
no wonder it's sturdy.

17:07.170 --> 17:08.300
Herbie!!!

17:09.880 --> 17:10.880
Hey!

17:12.130 --> 17:13.220
I see...

17:13.640 --> 17:15.156
So, the men pursuing her have finally...

17:15.180 --> 17:19.560
What! So you already knew
that she was being pursued?

17:19.850 --> 17:23.270
Huh? Well, yes... I just had a feeling...

17:26.570 --> 17:29.280
Well... maybe this is an opportune
moment...

17:32.630 --> 17:35.300
What the heck are you
doing with my wooden sword?!

17:39.250 --> 17:41.040
They're just like always, those two.

17:44.770 --> 17:46.140
Okay... This time...

17:46.850 --> 17:48.600
S-Say, Nadja...

17:49.680 --> 17:52.060
No... I mean... that is...

17:52.220 --> 17:53.760
Nadja... I lov-

17:56.950 --> 17:59.200
Rita! Are you all right?

18:03.990 --> 18:06.320
Thank goodness. You don't seem to be hurt.

18:07.380 --> 18:09.760
Ah! That's right! There was that time...

18:10.280 --> 18:13.110
They said that girl is named Phoebe.

18:13.150 --> 18:15.280
Apparently, she lost her
parents in an accident.

18:15.320 --> 18:16.700
Poor girl.

18:16.740 --> 18:20.240
Looking at her, I don't think
she'll recover anytime soon.

18:21.450 --> 18:23.960
Um... I am...

18:25.540 --> 18:27.670
Phoebe...

18:32.470 --> 18:33.470
Papa...

18:34.720 --> 18:35.720
Mama...

18:36.230 --> 18:38.511
No one's coming to get her,
no matter how long she waits.

18:38.680 --> 18:41.280
It takes time to accept the truth.

18:41.740 --> 18:44.040
Everyone's like that at first.

18:59.530 --> 19:01.160
But, it's been two weeks already.

19:01.200 --> 19:04.180
No matter how long she stays
depressed... her situation won't change.

19:05.000 --> 19:06.370
She can't help it...

19:06.600 --> 19:09.100
all we can do is
look out for her, right?

19:12.840 --> 19:14.220
Listen Phoebe...

19:16.050 --> 19:17.050
Phoebe...

19:21.390 --> 19:24.100
I know very well what you're feeling...

19:24.720 --> 19:27.100
That's because all the children here...

19:27.230 --> 19:29.900
have all had similar experiences.

19:36.820 --> 19:39.410
Listen... Even something that you
may not be able to do alone...

19:40.120 --> 19:42.700
maybe done if we
all do it together right?

19:43.580 --> 19:45.460
Here, we all do it that way...

19:46.000 --> 19:49.040
That's why you don't
have to bear this alone.

19:49.540 --> 19:51.710
If you want to cry,
it's all right to cry...

19:53.210 --> 19:56.470
Because we're family.

20:15.530 --> 20:17.320
That instant... I understood clearly...

20:18.030 --> 20:19.680
That Nadja, I lov-

20:20.360 --> 20:21.360
Lov?

20:23.540 --> 20:24.540
Oliver?

20:26.160 --> 20:27.160
Are you okay?

20:31.290 --> 20:32.790
Nadja I...

20:32.840 --> 20:33.840
Eh what?

20:33.880 --> 20:35.340
I... I...!

20:36.040 --> 20:37.040
I...!

20:38.170 --> 20:39.170
I...!

20:39.320 --> 20:40.320
We...

20:40.820 --> 20:42.780
are family aren't we?

20:44.160 --> 20:45.160
Of course!

20:45.400 --> 20:46.610
Everyone, please listen.

20:47.850 --> 20:50.690
It's sudden but I want you
to prepare to leave.

20:50.980 --> 20:52.690
I want to leave to today.

20:56.880 --> 20:58.750
We're leaving on a treasure hunt!

20:59.430 --> 21:00.540
See you then.

21:00.740 --> 21:01.910
Take care.

21:02.160 --> 21:05.910
Thank you, Herbie, Oliver and T.J.

21:06.260 --> 21:07.260
Hey...

21:09.640 --> 21:10.980
Listen up, Kennosuke!

21:11.000 --> 21:13.670
Until I see you again you
have to protect Nadja.

21:14.980 --> 21:16.900
You had better not make her cry.

21:17.050 --> 21:18.880
Like that day will come...

21:19.220 --> 21:21.470
It'll be fine... I know we'll meet again.

21:22.510 --> 21:24.180
Ah? Yeah~

21:24.840 --> 21:26.040
Lets get going!

21:26.200 --> 21:27.260
Yes sir!

21:28.260 --> 21:29.260
Nadja!

21:34.400 --> 21:35.400
See you again.

21:38.960 --> 21:41.700
Nadja~! Until we meet again!

21:42.360 --> 21:43.360
Nadja...

21:43.490 --> 21:47.240
Someday... Someday in the future,
I will definitely tell you how I feel.

21:47.740 --> 21:49.420
What?! What did you just say?

21:49.460 --> 21:50.460
Nothing.

21:50.550 --> 21:53.700
But why is Nadja being pursued
by those men...?

21:54.160 --> 21:55.720
There might be something there.

21:56.350 --> 21:57.940
Good bye, everyone!

21:58.150 --> 21:59.530
Good bye, Paris!

21:59.550 --> 22:01.300
- [A bientôt is "See you again soon" in French]
- A bientôt!

22:02.210 --> 22:03.420
In this manner, the troupe...

22:03.600 --> 22:08.260
left Paris, as if Destiny
was pushing their backs.

22:15.370 --> 22:16.995
Paris is sunnier than London

22:16.996 --> 22:18.620
RONDON don yori haretara PARI

22:18.740 --> 22:21.830
- Carmen likes paella more than pasta
- CARUMEN men yori PAERIYA suki

22:22.250 --> 22:25.335
The Queen of Spades is a fickle person

22:25.336 --> 22:28.420
SUPEEDO no jou kimagure yasan

22:29.380 --> 22:30.620
- Indeed
- Kitto

22:33.380 --> 22:35.800
- It's not use worrying about it
- Nayan datte MUDA yo

22:36.380 --> 22:37.945
Que sera sera, sera Sera

22:37.946 --> 22:39.510
KE SERA SERA SERA SERA

22:39.770 --> 22:42.125
Tomorrow's going to
be whatever it was meant

22:42.126 --> 22:44.480
Ashita nante itsumo naru you ni

22:44.560 --> 22:45.940
- To be, to be
- Naru naru

22:46.270 --> 22:48.775
The tree fog won

22:48.776 --> 22:51.280
Sekai KAERU tobi KONKUURU

22:51.740 --> 22:53.700
The world frog-jumping contest

22:53.701 --> 22:55.660
Yuushou shita yo AMAGAERU

22:58.870 --> 23:01.955
Under the kitten's paw

23:01.956 --> 23:05.040
Koneko chan no ashi no ura wa

23:05.460 --> 23:08.545
Is the scent of the sun, right?

23:08.546 --> 23:11.630
Otentou sama no nioi dane

23:14.470 --> 23:16.135
Paris is sunnier than London

23:16.136 --> 23:17.800
RONDON don yori haretara PARI

23:17.890 --> 23:20.890
- Carmen likes paella more than pasta
- CARUMEN men yori PAERIYA suki

23:21.390 --> 23:24.580
It's not the time to hang around

23:24.581 --> 23:27.770
Michikusa shite iru baai ja nai ne

23:28.650 --> 23:30.900
Indeed, indeed

23:30.901 --> 23:33.150
Kitto kitto

23:41.500 --> 23:42.880
- Tomorrow's Nadja
- Tomorrow's Nadja

23:43.420 --> 23:46.250
You are lying asleep somewhere...
I want to find you...

23:46.770 --> 23:49.990
So I'm able to overcome any peril...

23:50.950 --> 23:54.620
If we can make the discovery
we'll have an easy life?

23:54.910 --> 23:58.420
Gold, silver and jewels! My
chest fills with expectations!

24:00.460 --> 24:02.880
Everything is at the place
marked on this map...

24:03.640 --> 24:04.860
Tomorrow's Nadja:

24:04.900 --> 24:06.840
Treasure Hunting is Romantic!?

